				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Reports are recorded so that a problem can be understood after it happened. Analysing them means three steps: find the reports you need (by type, day or image, from their metadata only), read them back into report objects, and then query those objects like any other objects. How to record and store reports is on {{gtPage:GT reports available for data collection}}; how the infrastructure works is on {{gtPage:Report infrastructure for collecting data in GT}}."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
