							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Inspect the store to browse its folder ({{gtMethod:GtReportsLocalStore>>#gtRootFolderFor:|label=#selector}}). Every folder with a `meta.json` is one stored report; {{gtClass:GtStoredReportFiles}} {{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles class>>#folder:|label=#selector}} reads its metadata and shows it ({{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles>>#gtMetadataFor:|label=#selector}}), lists its files ({{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles>>#gtFilesFor:|label=#selector}}), and its *Read* action reads the report back ({{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles>>#gtReadReportActionFor:|label=#selector}}). A folder without `meta.json` is an interrupted write and is not found below."
						},
