							"string" : "| Object | What it is | Useful messages |\n|---|---|---|\n| {{gtClass:GtStoredReportFiles}} | one stored report folder, with its metadata already read | {{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles>>#metadata|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles>>#folder|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles>>#reportClass|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtStoredReportFiles>>#report|label=#selector}} |\n| {{gtClass:GtReportMetadata}} | the content of `meta.json` | {{gtMethod:GtReportMetadata>>#reportType|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtReportMetadata>>#storedAt|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtReportMetadata>>#reportUid|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtReportMetadata>>#storageId|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtReportMetadata>>#files|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtReportMetadata>>#imageData|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtReportMetadata>>#formatVersion|label=#selector}} |\n| {{gtClass:GtReportFileDescription}} | one data file listed in the metadata | {{gtMethod:GtReportFileDescription>>#name|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtReportFileDescription>>#numberOfBytes|label=#selector}} |\n| the report | the object that was recorded, read back from its files (e.g. {{gtClass:GtMessageTallyReport}}) | its own accessors and views, and {{gtMethod:GtProcessesReport>>#imageData|label=#selector}} |"
